{"type":"assistant","uuid":"01a0a96b-4005-7eaa-8a50-3bd910408c1a","session_id":"01a0a96a-c480-78d1-9343-f2624a150c34","message":{"id":"01a0a96b40057eaa8a503bd72ad8f745","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The search has returned a clear answer with multiple sources. The most authoritative source is the official TypeScript documentation release notes for TypeScript 4.9. Let me provide a concise answer in Chinese with the cited source URL.","signature":""}],"model":"fast-model","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a0a96ac5c3715cad85b845f1091d3a","_messageId":"01a0a96b40057eaa8a503bd72ad8f745","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"01a0a96ac5c3715cad85b845f1091d3a","codebuddy.ai/modelRequestId":"01a0a96b40057eaa8a503bd72ad8f745","codebuddy.ai/llmMessageId":"01a0a96b40057eaa8a503bd72ad8f745","codebuddy.ai/messageId":"01a0a96b-4005-7eaa-8a50-3bd910408c1a","traceparent":"00-f85fb051ff1149477d3e96f413e52523-7470a98ba4e63c84-01","baggage":"codebuddy.session_id=01a0a96a-c480-78d1-9343-f2624a150c34,codebuddy.conversation_request_id=01a0a96ac5c3715cad85b845f1091d3a"},"__timestamp":"2026-09-16T08:52:58.522Z"}
{"type":"assistant","uuid":"01a0a96b-4005-7eaa-8a50-3bd86524c8b4","session_id":"01a0a96a-c480-78d1-9343-f2624a150c34","message":{"id":"01a0a96b40057eaa8a503bd72ad8f745","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# TypeScript `satisfies` 运算符\n\n`satisfies` 是 TypeScript 4.9 引入的运算符，用于**验证表达式的类型与目标类型兼容，但不改变（替换）该表达式的推断类型**。\n\n## 核心特性\n\n- **类型检查**：确保表达式类型与指定类型兼容（如字段缺失、类型不匹配时会报错）。\n- **保留推断类型**：不会像 `: Type` 注解那样将类型\"收窄\"为注解类型，表达式仍保留更精确（literal/narrow）的推断类型，从而获得更好的自动补全与推断能力。\n\n## 示例\n\n```ts\ntype Colors = \"red\" | \"green\" | \"blue\";\ntype RGB = [number, number, number];\n\nconst palette = {\n  red: [255, 0, 0],\n  green: \"#00ff00\",\n  bleu: [0, 0, 255], // ❌ 拼写错误，触发 satisfies 报错\n} satisfies Record<Colors, string | RGB>;\n\n// palette.red 仍被推断为 number[]，而非 string | RGB\n```\n\n如果不使用 `satisfies`，直接 `: Record<Colors, string | RGB>` 注解会让 `palette.red` 变成 `string | RGB`，丢失元组信息。\n\n## 来源\n\n- TypeScript 官方文档（4.9 发布说明）：https://www.typescriptlang.org/docs/handbook/release-notes/typescript-4-9.html"}],"model":"fast-model","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":38338,"output_tokens":345,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5555,"cache_read_input_tokens":32783,"cache_creation":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a0a96ac5c3715cad85b845f1091d3a","_messageId":"01a0a96b40057eaa8a503bd72ad8f745","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"01a0a96ac5c3715cad85b845f1091d3a","codebuddy.ai/modelRequestId":"01a0a96b40057eaa8a503bd72ad8f745","codebuddy.ai/llmMessageId":"01a0a96b40057eaa8a503bd72ad8f745","codebuddy.ai/messageId":"01a0a96b-4005-7eaa-8a50-3bd86524c8b4","traceparent":"00-f85fb051ff1149477d3e96f413e52523-7470a98ba4e63c84-01","baggage":"codebuddy.session_id=01a0a96a-c480-78d1-9343-f2624a150c34,codebuddy.conversation_request_id=01a0a96ac5c3715cad85b845f1091d3a"},"__timestamp":"2026-09-16T08:52:59.014Z"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"result":"# TypeScript `satisfies` 运算符\n\n`satisfies` 是 TypeScript 4.9 引入的运算符，用于**验证表达式的类型与目标类型兼容，但不改变（替换）该表达式的推断类型**。\n\n## 核心特性\n\n- **类型检查**：确保表达式类型与指定类型兼容（如字段缺失、类型不匹配时会报错）。\n- **保留推断类型**：不会像 `: Type` 注解那样将类型\"收窄\"为注解类型，表达式仍保留更精确（literal/narrow）的推断类型，从而获得更好的自动补全与推断能力。\n\n## 示例\n\n```ts\ntype Colors = \"red\" | \"green\" | \"blue\";\ntype RGB = [number, number, number];\n\nconst palette = {\n  red: [255, 0, 0],\n  green: \"#00ff00\",\n  bleu: [0, 0, 255], // ❌ 拼写错误，触发 satisfies 报错\n} satisfies Record<Colors, string | RGB>;\n\n// palette.red 仍被推断为 number[]，而非 string | RGB\n```\n\n如果不使用 `satisfies`，直接 `: Record<Colors, string | RGB>` 注解会让 `palette.red` 变成 `string | RGB`，丢失元组信息。\n\n## 来源\n\n- TypeScript 官方文档（4.9 发布说明）：https://www.typescriptlang.org/docs/handbook/release-notes/typescript-4-9.html","uuid":"01a0a96b-560c-7e46-acc4-886e869bb456","session_id":"01a0a96a-c480-78d1-9343-f2624a150c34","duration_ms":33770,"duration_api_ms":33769,"num_turns":10,"total_cost_usd":0,"usage":{"input_tokens":135938,"output_tokens":548,"cache_creation_input_tokens":38122,"cache_read_input_tokens":97816,"cache_creation":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null},"permission_denials":[],"modelUsage":{"fast-model":{"inputTokens":0,"outputTokens":548,"cacheReadInputTokens":97816,"cacheCreationInputTokens":38122,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000}},"_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/contextUsed":38338,"codebuddy.ai/usageByCategory":{"systemPrompt":2228,"conversation":10592,"tools":25469,"mcp":25,"skills":24,"version":1},"traceparent":"00-f85fb051ff1149477d3e96f413e52523-7470a98ba4e63c84-01","baggage":"codebuddy.session_id=01a0a96a-c480-78d1-9343-f2624a150c34,codebuddy.conversation_request_id=01a0a96ac5c3715cad85b845f1091d3a"},"__timestamp":"2026-09-16T08:52:59.045Z","_requestId":"01a0a96ac5c3715cad85b845f1091d3a"}
